flowchart TD
    A[Define why statement and success measures] --> B[Select cross-functional pilot]
    B --> C[Communicate scope and expectations]
    C --> D[Week 1: orientation and guided practice]
    D --> E[Collect feedback and fix high-impact issues]
    E --> F[Week 2: exception practice and reporting]
    F --> G[Review metrics, confidence, and open risks]
    G --> H{Go / revise / stop}
    H -->|Go| I[Plan controlled rollout]
    H -->|Revise| J[Update workflow and retrain]
    J --> D
    H -->|Stop| K[Document rationale and close pilot]
